  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "1.town",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.0667,
      "text": "In this town, my family stole things."
    },
    {
      "id": "1.night",
      "start": 2.0667,
      "end": 4.2,
      "text": "Every night, a boy left berries on our sill."
    },
    {
      "id": "1.back",
      "start": 4.2,
      "end": 5.6,
      "text": "He was buying back what we took."
    },
    {
      "id": "1.gift",
      "start": 5.6,
      "end": 6.7333,
      "text": "Then I stole a gift."
    },
    {
      "id": "2.why",
      "start": 6.7333,
      "end": 7.6,
      "text": "Here's how he did it."
    },
    {
      "id": "2.carry",
      "start": 7.6,
      "end": 10.9,
      "text": "We carry one thing in our mouth, and if we find food, we drop it to eat."
    },
    {
      "id": "2.worked",
      "start": 10.9,
      "end": 13.9,
      "text": "He worked that out. He left food, we left the thing."
    },
    {
      "id": "3.dad",
      "start": 13.9,
      "end": 16.8667,
      "text": "My dad took a sword once. My sister took a whole cooked chicken."
    },
    {
      "id": "3.me",
      "start": 16.8667,
      "end": 18.3667,
      "text": "I was the worst thief we ever had."
    },
    {
      "id": "3.flower",
      "start": 18.3667,
      "end": 20.8667,
      "text": "So one night I took a red flower off his sill."
    },
    {
      "id": "4.night",
      "start": 20.8667,
      "end": 23.3667,
      "text": "On my first night alone my dad gave me the rules."
    },
    {
      "id": "4.one",
      "start": 23.3667,
      "end": 25.5333,
      "text": "\"One thing, and nothing anybody is holding.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "4.window",
      "start": 25.5333,
      "end": 27.6667,
      "text": "Then I saw the window with a cup on the sill,"
    },
    {
      "id": "4.width",
      "start": 27.6667,
      "end": 29.0333,
      "text": "open a hand's width every night,"
    },
    {
      "id": "4.cup",
      "start": 29.0333,
      "end": 30.9667,
      "text": "and in the cup, one red flower."
    },
    {
      "id": "5.climb",
      "start": 30.9667,
      "end": 32.4333,
      "text": "I didn't even have to climb."
    },
    {
      "id": "5.easy",
      "start": 32.4333,
      "end": 35.6,
      "text": "It was the easiest thing I ever took. Not a sword. A flower,"
    },
    {
      "id": "5.thought",
      "start": 35.6,
      "end": 37.3667,
      "text": "and I thought, this is a thing that matters."
    },
    {
      "id": "5.home",
      "start": 37.3667,
      "end": 38.7667,
      "text": "I carried it home in my mouth."
    },
    {
      "id": "6.hedge",
      "start": 38.7667,
      "end": 40.9,
      "text": "In the morning I watched the house from the hedge,"
    },
    {
      "id": "6.boy",
      "start": 40.9,
      "end": 42.2333,
      "text": "and the boy came out to the cup,"
    },
    {
      "id": "6.cried",
      "start": 42.2333,
      "end": 44.8333,
      "text": "he looked in it, then he sat on the step and cried."
    },
    {
      "id": "6.golem",
      "start": 44.8333,
      "end": 47.1333,
      "text": "The iron golem came up the path and stopped."
    },
    {
      "id": "6.gave",
      "start": 47.1333,
      "end": 49.7667,
      "text": "It gave him that flower. I worked that out later."
    },
    {
      "id": "7.sister",
      "start": 49.7667,
      "end": 52.3333,
      "text": "My sister found me in the hedge with a whole chicken in her mouth."
    },
    {
      "id": "7.said",
      "start": 52.3333,
      "end": 56.2333,
      "text": "\"You took a thing that was a present,\" she said. \"That's not stealing. That's hurting,\""
    },
    {
      "id": "7.day",
      "start": 56.2333,
      "end": 58.8,
      "text": "\"take it back in the day. That's the only way it counts.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "8.walk",
      "start": 58.8,
      "end": 61.9,
      "text": "So I went back in the day, a fox in a village at noon,"
    },
    {
      "id": "8.dogs",
      "start": 61.9,
      "end": 64.5,
      "text": "and every dog in that town knew before I did."
    },
    {
      "id": "8.turn",
      "start": 64.5,
      "end": 67.0,
      "text": "I got halfway up the path and the golem turned round,"
    },
    {
      "id": "8.ran",
      "start": 67.0,
      "end": 69.2333,
      "text": "so I ran with the flower still in my mouth."
    },
    {
      "id": "9.night",
      "start": 69.2333,
      "end": 72.1,
      "text": "That night there were berries on the sill, a little pile, red,"
    },
    {
      "id": "9.drop",
      "start": 72.1,
      "end": 73.0667,
      "text": "and I dropped the flower,"
    },
    {
      "id": "9.ate",
      "start": 73.0667,
      "end": 75.0667,
      "text": "because of course I ate them, that's what a fox does."
    },
    {
      "id": "9.nothing",
      "start": 75.0667,
      "end": 76.9667,
      "text": "Then I went home with nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "id": "10.next",
      "start": 76.9667,
      "end": 78.6667,
      "text": "Next night, more berries than ever."
    },
    {
      "id": "10.told",
      "start": 78.6667,
      "end": 81.5667,
      "text": "\"He's not scared of us,\" my sister said. \"He's waiting.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "11.corner",
      "start": 81.5667,
      "end": 84.1667,
      "text": "So I looked in our den, behind all of it, berries."
    },
    {
      "id": "11.count",
      "start": 84.1667,
      "end": 86.3,
      "text": "One berry under every single thing we ever took."
    },
    {
      "id": "11.every",
      "start": 86.3,
      "end": 88.5333,
      "text": "Every one. He counted every one."
    },
    {
      "id": "11.gift",
      "start": 88.5333,
      "end": 91.2,
      "text": "Then I looked at the cup, and the golem, and the flower,"
    },
    {
      "id": "11.given",
      "start": 91.2,
      "end": 94.1667,
      "text": "and I got it. That flower wasn't stolen. It was given."
    },
    {
      "id": "12.none",
      "start": 94.1667,
      "end": 95.4,
      "text": "So he couldn't buy it back."
    },
    {
      "id": "12.trade",
      "start": 95.4,
      "end": 97.7,
      "text": "He was paying us back, one thing a night,"
    },
    {
      "id": "12.want",
      "start": 97.7,
      "end": 100.5333,
      "text": "and the one thing he wanted was the one thing we never sold."
    },
    {
      "id": "12.flower",
      "start": 100.5333,
      "end": 102.8333,
      "text": "And in the cup that morning, a new flower,"
    },
    {
      "id": "12.second",
      "start": 102.8333,
      "end": 105.0667,
      "text": "and a second cup beside it. Empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "13.berry",
      "start": 105.0667,
      "end": 106.6667,
      "text": "So I put a berry in it."
    },
    {
      "id": "13.bad",
      "start": 106.6667,
      "end": 107.8667,
      "text": "I'm a terrible thief."
    },
    {
      "id": "13.sister",
      "start": 107.8667,
      "end": 110.4,
      "text": "My sister says it's the first thing I ever took worth anything."
    },
    {
      "id": "13.only",
      "start": 110.4,
      "end": 112.9,
      "text": "In this town my family stole things. I traded."
    },
    {
      "id": "14.sub",
      "start": 112.9,
      "end": 115.5,
      "text": "Subscribe before I find out what he wants for the sword."
    }
  ],
